        <detaileddescription>
<para>Callback type for fetching a document from the local storage engine when no replicas are configured (single-node deployment). Arguments: collection, document_id. Returns: {serialised document data, version}. An empty data string is valid when the document does not exist; version 0 means unknown.</para>
<para>Injection API for the single-node local read path. Provides concrete document content/version when no replica topology is present. </para>
